    {
        "id": "99ff09842150a809",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "ee316a5134bafa11",
        "name": "Readme",
        "info": "Two nodes need to be installed:\n1 (needed) :  threshold-hysteresis \n2 (optional) : interactive-inject\n\nAn additional contactor is used to completely disconnect the system from the power grid. This is connected into Relay 2 in the Cerbo and use COM to NC contacts. Then the Cerbo needs setting - Integration - Relay 2 - Polarity = Normally closed\n\nThe Cerbo DI is used to override the Soc/Volt logic externally.\n\nNote: After a full deploy (to Multiplus), sometimes 3 messages arrive at same time",
        "x": 580,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
